<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Burlington raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Burlington raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has raised its rating for Burlington Resources Inc to buy from hold, a source at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares opened down 1/8 to 51-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
